# REGIONAL RULES: Auditor de Seguridad Web Project

## Tech Stack

- Framework: Next.js 14+ (App Router)

- Language: TypeScript

- Styling: Tailwind CSS

- Icons: Lucide-React

## Architectural Principles

- Clean Code, Component-driven architecture.

- All API routes must handle exceptions gracefully and return structured JSON.

- Never write hardcoded API keys or secrets in source files. Always use process.env.

## Security Constraints

- Do not execute system commands using sudo.

- Sanitize all user inputs before processing or rendering.

